# GRUB SHIFT: rolling into a grub pushes it one tile; pushed into a pit, it's gone.
game grubshift
wait 5
cheat contract 1 7
cheat clear
cheat bug 4 3 2 1
cheat hole 5 3
cheat use 0 4 3
expect kills == 1
expect px == 4
cheat bug 4 2 3 0
cheat use 1 4 2
expect bug_at43 == 0
expect bug_at41 == 3
expect py == 2
